# Fichier de config scene
# ========================
# Structure for creating a scene:
# START
# <id_scene>                        Unique ID for the scene
# <number_enemy_to_spawn_type_1>    Number of enemies of type 1 to spawn
# <spawn_rate_type_1>               Spawn rate for enemies of type 1 (in seconds)
# <number_enemy_to_spawn_type_2>    Number of enemies of type 2 to spawn
# <spawn_rate_type_2>               Spawn rate for enemies of type 2 (in seconds)
# <number_enemy_to_spawn_type_3>    Number of enemies of type 3 to spawn
# <spawn_rate_type_3>               Spawn rate for enemies of type 3 (in seconds)
# <id_boss>                         ID for the boss: 1 = Boss 1, 2 = Boss 2, 0 = No boss
# END
# Example:
# START
# 1
# 20
# 2
# 10
# 1
# 5
# 3
# 0
# END

START
